    "text": "3 hours ago The Mission Gilbert will hold a hiring fair on December 1, 2, 8, and 9, 2025. The event runs from 11 a.m. to 3 p.m. at The Tyler Gilbert, 3150 E Ray Rd, Gilbert, AZ 85296.\nWalk-in applicants can apply for front-of-house and back-of-house positions. The fair is open to job seekers in the Gilbert, Arizona area.\nVisit here for more details This post includes content assisted by AI tools. Please refer to the source for verification and additional information. Learn more.",
